{"id":60515,"date":"2026-08-19T10:59:36","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T09:59:36","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:51:28","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:51:28","slug":"gp-atletismo-freguseia-da-erada","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/gp-atletismo-freguseia-da-erada\/","title":{"rendered":"GP Atletismo Freguesia da Erada 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">GP Atletismo Freguesia da Erada 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>5\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo Freguesia da Erada 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na encantadora vila da <strong>Erada<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Covilh\u00e3<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia da Erada<\/strong> com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Covilh\u00e3<\/strong>, do N\u00facleo de Desporto da Filarm\u00f3nica da Erada, suporte t\u00e9cnico da <strong>PTN &#8211; Eventos Desportivos<\/strong> e ajuizamento da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta no <strong>Jardim P\u00fablico da Erada<\/strong>, a jornada desportiva arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:40<\/strong> com a <strong>PTN One Mile (1,6 km)<\/strong> para escal\u00f5es jovens, seguida da <strong>Corrida da Pequenada Kids (350 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:00, da <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:05 e da <strong>Corrida Principal de 9 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:15. O percurso apresenta tra\u00e7ado misto (50% asfalto e 50% terra batida) nas encostas da Serra da Estrela, incluindo almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e oferta de leit\u00e3o assado para as duas equipas mais numerosas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wr